{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045440/extras/29028ada44bf3c5f3ac1ac350f35bb47.avif?t=1759145160\" width=609 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to cook and manage the kitchen\u2014<strong>unless you\u2019re the traitor, whose mission is to ruin everything!</strong> Fast-paced, hilarious, and full of sabotage. <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045440/extras/a626f925e9dd91e1bb86bfaf68a99d44.poster.avif?t=1759145160\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045440/extras/a626f925e9dd91e1bb86bfaf68a99d44.webm?t=1759145160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045440/extras/a626f925e9dd91e1bb86bfaf68a99d44.mp4?t=1759145160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traitor's Kitchen</strong> is a social deduction party game where chefs rush to deliver meals on time  while the traitor tries to ruin the deliveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045440/extras/d5fe65030fc0dca0a75f5cd6c1556b25.poster.avif?t=1759145160\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045440/extras/d5fe65030fc0dca0a75f5cd6c1556b25.webm?t=1759145160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045440/extras/d5fe65030fc0dca0a75f5cd6c1556b25.mp4?t=1759145160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stop the traitor\u2019s sabotages:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Electricity and gas can suddenly shut down, and the kitchen can instantly become a mess!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045440/extras/19cdf8e09c00b7330214b3ef73eba3a6.poster.avif?t=1759145160\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045440/extras/19cdf8e09c00b7330214b3ef73eba3a6.webm?t=1759145160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045440/extras/19cdf8e09c00b7330214b3ef73eba3a6.mp4?t=1759145160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take out the trash and keep the kitchen clean:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Working in the kitchen isn\u2019t just about cooking. You also need to care about cleanliness and regularly take out the garbage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045440/extras/267b9cf3e9f3e355199dd1301a9ea278.poster.avif?t=1759145160\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045440/extras/267b9cf3e9f3e355199dd1301a9ea278.webm?t=1759145160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045440/extras/267b9cf3e9f3e355199dd1301a9ea278.mp4?t=1759145160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find the traitor and deliver meals simultaneously!</strong><br>Or sabotage the deliveries <i>without revealing</i> that <strong>you are the traitor!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4045440?t=1759145160","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4045440?t=1759145160","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045440/c900526ce3e9d472de81ba8cb113b81f12bc890b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759145160","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045440/c900526ce3e9d472de81ba8cb113b81f12bc890b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759145160","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045440/extras/29028ada44bf3c5f3ac1ac350f35bb47.avif?t=1759145160\" width=609 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to cook and manage the kitchen\u2014<strong>unless you\u2019re the traitor, whose mission is to ruin everything!<